{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=SoulGlad™ Scorchsand Audition Venue|update|You are about to face the final and most challenging stage of the SoulGlad™ Festivity Auditions &mdash; "The Superstar Showdown"! Only they who laugh last in the ring will be able to become the next Penacony Festive Superstar...<br />Will that person be you? Or will it be the towering, strong, passionate nobleman who easily secured the top score in the acting challenge? Stay tuned to find out!}}
