:'''Argenti:''' Please wait! {{MC|м=Handsome gentleman, beautiful miss|ж=My beautiful ladies}}...
::'''Argenti:''' By the glorious light of Beauty! I never thought I would see you again. In such turbulent times, your kind faces are as spring's gentle breeze, bringing solace to my scorched heart!
::'''Firefly:''' Are you... a Knight of Beauty?
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Ahhhwww?
:::'''Argenti:''' Hear ye! The rosy glow of the Beauty has rendered you speechless &mdash; what an honor!
:::So the red-haired contestant was you all along!
:::'''Argenti:''' You've already heard of my humble title elsewhere? I am deeply honored!
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} So the red-haired contestant was you all along!
:::'''Argenti:''' You've already heard of my humble title elsewhere? I am deeply honored!
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Will you be participating in the Charmony Festival as well?
:::Will you be participating in the Charmony Festival as well?
:::'''Argenti:''' Upon hearing of the impending festivities, I commanded the One and Only to bring me to Penacony with full haste. Alas, in a cosmos unguarded by the Beauty, disorder prevails, thus my passage was delayed by tending to the sick and injured...
:::'''Argenti:''' Fortunately, the Mini Rabbit Mech Pilot, Stray Cat Duelist, Galactic Ninja, and Quad-drive Intellitron, along with thirty-two other souls in distress, all emerged from their predicaments safe and sound... I then led them all here to revel in the harmony with the countless other splendid beings.
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Is this the Beauty? It's dazzling...
::::'''Argenti:''' I do not deserve such praise! Unfortunately, that dashing IPC Ambassador, whose radiance matches that of a beautiful peacock, remains in a woeful state... How I wish he too could partake in this splendid occasion.
::::'''Argenti:''' Okay, let's get back to business. Since fate has brought us together, it stands to reason that you both seek the accolade of the audition's victor, correct?
::::You're quite the savior, aren't ya...
::::'''Argenti:''' I do not deserve such praise! Unfortunately, that dashing IPC Ambassador, whose radiance matches that of a beautiful peacock, remains in a woeful state... How I wish he too could partake in this splendid occasion.
::::'''Argenti:''' Okay, let's get back to business. Since fate has brought us together, it stands to reason that you both seek the accolade of the audition's victor, correct?
::::I'm busy saving the world. Could you please make way?
::::'''Argenti:''' Saving the world? What a righteous act of Beauty! If that's the case...
::::'''Argenti:''' ...No, that won't do. The rules of the contest are sacred and inviolable, just like the Beauty.
::::'''Argenti:''' Hmm... What would be the noblest choice...?
::::We need to seal the Stellaron on Penacony.
::::'''Firefly:''' That's right. This magnificent dream is built upon the Stellaron and the countless sacrifices of many people.
::::'''Argenti:''' Oh? To encounter deeds so vile they stir one's very soul...
::::'''Argenti:''' However, present-day Penacony bears no marks of the Stellaron's taint and The Family has always been renowned for spreading Harmony... How can I be sure your words hold truth?
::::Tell the truth about the Watchmaker and the Stellaron.
::::'''Firefly:''' If I'm not wrong, the Knights of Beauty also received an invitation from the Watchmaker, right?
::::'''Argenti:''' That's right. But what does this have to do with the Stellaron?
::::'''Firefly:''' Actually, we've already met the Watchmaker...
::::You revealed to Argenti all the truths about the Watchmaker and the Penacony Stellaron...
::::'''Argenti:''' Hmm...
::::'''Argenti:''' It's clear to me now. Evidently, you are traveling in pursuit of the Beauty's ideals.
::::'''Argenti:''' Go forth, my dear friend, beautiful miss, the audition's crown is yours to claim! I shall remain here, gazing from afar as you bask in the limelight, joining the audience in offering you the most heartfelt cheers and applause.
::::'''Firefly:''' Thank you, Knight of Beauty! We don't have much time left... May we meet again.
::::You don't trust your dear friend!?
::::'''Argenti:''' Hmm...
::::'''Argenti:''' Forgive me, my dear friends. If you cannot present irrefutable evidence, I must not yield, lest I dishonor the name of the Knights of Beauty.
::::'''Argenti:''' But if what you say is true... In the name of Beauty, let us use this fated duel to test your mettle!
::::I'm begging you, all I speak is the truth!
::::'''Argenti:''' Hmm...
::::'''Argenti:''' Forgive me, my dear friends. If you cannot present irrefutable evidence, I must not yield, lest I dishonor the name of the Knights of Beauty.
::::'''Argenti:''' But if what you say is true... In the name of Beauty, let us use this fated duel to test your mettle!
::::'''Argenti:''' Though upon arrival, I was once mistaken for a towering, silver-armored fugitive with fiery red flames, due to my lack of eloquence... it matters not, for all these trials stem from the Land of Dream's Beauty.
